ChalkBox Classic Quest Item Reference — Source Notice

The compact item/quest association data in Data.lua was derived from the
archived MIT-licensed shagu/pfQuest repository, not Questie or QuestieDB.

Source: https://github.com/shagu/pfQuest
Quest relationships: db/quests.lua, Git blob 4262ea4e1affd732587b0ffb8e2c91ec9ae1642a
English quest titles: db/enUS/quests.lua, Git blob bc579f24b77c50c02d8c243361f27186b57e1eb8

The source is a historic Classic reference and is not a verification of
current WoW Forever quests. Runtime live quest objectives always take priority.

